# DeckVault — TCG Collection Manager

Supported games: Yu-Gi-Oh, Pokemon, Digimon.

## Product scope (current)

DeckVault is a local-only collection manager. The installed Windows app is the primary product; local browser use is secondary.

**In scope:** collection views, Search/Quick Add, import CSV/decklist, export, collection manager, Anime Collection, proxy print, local activity + undo, CardTrader purchase indicators, IndexedDB persistence, JSON backup/restore and Windows updates.

**Out of scope:** accounts/authentication, Supabase/cloud sync, collection sharing/collaboration, realtime presence, community features, price history, trading and notifications.

## Data

- Collection data and persisted UI preferences live in IndexedDB.
- JSON backup/restore is the supported way to move data between computers.
- External network services are used only for catalogs, images and configured marketplace data.
- Protect local data first when changing persistence, backup, restore or update flows.

## Roadmap

**Now:** data safety, backup/restore, collection UX, performance, purchase matching and Windows installer reliability.

**Later:** stats summaries, broader bulk editing, binder virtualization and other local-first quality improvements.
